```
If `func` is a coroutine function, calling it returns a coroutine object. `run_in_threadpool` will return that coroutine object.
Then `solved = await run_in_threadpool(...)` will await that coroutine object.
Wait, if `run_in_threadpool` returns a coroutine object, then `await run_in_threadpool(...)` will await it.

